<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Comms lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Comms lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Kurt Abkemeier downgraded 360 Communications Co to marketperformer from buy with a 1998 year-end price target of $21.</p>
<p>-- said in a report &quot;the company has been plagued with several executional errors over the last two quarters, which has led to a slowdown in its operating cash flow growth and net income growth trajectory.&quot;</p>
<p>-- the stockw was up 5/16 to 17-7/16.</p>
</text>
